4,"Taznatit Language (GRR) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/grr/,"Taznatit is an endangered indigenous language of Algeria and Morocco. It belongs to the Afro-Asiatic language family. The language is used as a first language by all adults in the ethnic community, but not all young people. It is not known to be taught in schools.",Taznatit,Afro-Asiatic
